# QUESTDB acetone rows 1B2(n,3s) and 1B2(n,3pz): active (4,2,1,0), state average (A1,B2)=(1,2), (6e,7o).
# Rotations undo the energy sort ORCA applies when reading these orbitals with UseSym.
! aug-cc-pVTZ RIJCOSX AutoAux TightSCF UseSym MORead
%moinp "acetone_c_valence_avtz_nosym.gbw"
%maxcore 2000
%pal nprocs 4 end
%scf
  rotate
    {7,13,90}
    {17,46,90}
    {18,107,90}
  end
end
%casscf
  nel 6
  norb 7
  mult 1,1
  irrep 0,3
  nroots 1,2
  trafostep ri
  orbstep TRAH
  maxiter 150
  PTMethod SC_NEVPT2
end
